\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0   Let's keep doing good always,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0\qj That we'll never wear from good works
\par For at the season ordained,
\par We shall rest from all our labour,
\par But it won't be only rest,
\par What was sown, we'll also reap.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Let's observe the farms we have,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 And from these, spiritually learn,
\par He that shall miserly sow
\par Shall surely reap miserliness,
\par He that does good works on earth,
\par Surely have the best above.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Small  though the seeds that we sow,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 It keeps constantly increasing.
\par The acts of men here on earth
\par Shall receive abundant reward,
\par  Thus, all that you do on earth
\par Shall be justly rewarded.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.  Jesus, bid me do the right,
\par \pard\li225\sl180\slmult0 And conduct my life honestly,
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0 For this is the day ordained.
\par But  goodness is ne'er belated.
\par If I do perform good works,
\par It all shall surely be well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl180\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  It is in faith that I sow,
\par \pard\li315\sl180\slmult0 In harvest time, I shall rejoice.
\par What I'll do will be but, small,
\par Your reward will be just great,
\par For a reward, I'm unfit,
\par For your grace is abundant.
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

